@startuml Sequence Diagram — Transfert Wallet
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Diagramme de Séquence — Transfert entre Wallets

actor "Client" as Client
participant "TransactionsController\n(wallets/:id/transfer)" as Controller
participant "JwtAuthGuard" as Auth
participant "TransactionsService" as Service
participant "PinService" as PinService
participant "WalletsService" as WalletsService
participant "EntityManager\n(DB Transaction)" as EM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Requête HTTP ==

Client -> Controller: POST /api/v1/wallets/:id/transfer\n{ toWalletId, amount, pin, description? }
Controller -> Auth: canActivate()
Auth -> Auth: Verify JWT token\n(decode, check expiry, signature)
Auth --> Controller: { id: userId }

== Validation initiale ==

Controller -> Service: transfer(fromId, userId, dto)
Service -> Service: Vérifier fromId ≠ dto.toWalletId\n(same wallet transfer = interdit)

Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate EM

== Verrouillage pessimiste (ordre des IDs pour anti-deadlock) ==

Service -> WalletsService: lockWalletForUpdate(manager, firstId)\n[premier ID trié]
WalletsService -> EM: SELECT … FOR UPDATE
EM --> WalletsService: wallet_row
WalletsService --> Service: wallet_row

Service -> WalletsService: lockWalletForUpdate(manager, secondId)\n[deuxième ID trié]
WalletsService -> EM: SELECT … FOR UPDATE
EM --> WalletsService: wallet_row
WalletsService --> Service: wallet_row

== Vérification PIN du wallet source ==

Service -> PinService: verifyPinWithManager(manager, fromId, userId, pin)
PinService -> EM: SELECT … FOR UPDATE (lock wallet source)
EM --> PinService: wallet
PinService -> WalletsService: assertOwnership(wallet, userId)
PinService -> PinService: Vérifier pinHash existe\n(sinon → erreur : "aucun PIN configuré")
PinService -> PinService: Vérifier lockedUntil\n(silocké → erreur : "wallet verrouillé X min")
PinService -> PinService: argon2.verify(pinHash, pin)
alt PIN incorrect
  PinService -> EM: failedPinAttempts + 1
  alt attempts ≥ 5
    PinService -> EM: failedPinAttempts = 0\nlockedUntil = now + 15min
    PinService --> Service: throw ForbiddenException\n("trop de tentatives")
  else
    PinService --> Service: throw ForbiddenException\n("PIN incorrect")
  end
else PIN correct
  PinService -> EM: reset failedPinAttempts\n& lockedUntil
end
PinService --> Service: wallet (source vérifié)

== Vérification statut wallet source ==

Service -> WalletsService: assertActive(fromWallet)
note right: WalletsService.assertActive()\nVérifie wallet.status === ACTIVE\nSi INACTIVE → BadRequestException\n("wallet inactif — activation requise")

== Vérification wallet destination ==

Service -> WalletsService: lockWalletForUpdate(manager, toWalletId)
WalletsService -> EM: SELECT … FOR UPDATE
EM --> WalletsService: toWallet
WalletsService --> Service: toWallet

Service -> WalletsService: assertActive(toWallet)
note right: Le wallet destination doit\naussi être ACTIVE

== Contrôles de cohérence ==

Service -> Service: fromWallet.currency = toWalletCurrency ?
alt Devises différentes
  Service --> Client: 400 "Transfert entre devises différentes\nnon supporté"
  Service -> DB: ROLLBACK
end

Service -> Service: fromWallet.balance ≥ amount ?
alt Solde insuffisant
  Service --> Client: 400 "Solde insuffisant"
  Service -> DB: ROLLBACK
end

== Écritures comptables (ledger immuable) ==

Service -> EM: INSERT wallet_transactions\n(type: TRANSFER_OUT, walletId: from,\namount, relatedWalletId: to)
Service -> EM: INSERT wallet_transactions\n(type: TRANSFER_IN, walletId: to,\namount, relatedWalletId: from)
EM --> Service: 2 rows saved

== Recalcul des soldes (projections du ledger) ==

Service -> EM: SUM(deposits + transfer_in)\n- SUM(withdrawals + transfer_out)\nWHERE walletId = fromId
EM --> Service: newFromBalance

Service -> EM: SUM(deposits + transfer_in)\n- SUM(withdrawals + transfer_out)\nWHERE walletId = toWalletId
EM --> Service: newToBalance

Service -> EM: UPDATE wallets\nSET balance = newFromBalance\nWHERE id = fromId
Service -> EM: UPDATE wallets\nSET balance = newToBalance\nWHERE id = toWalletId

== Finalisation ==

Service -> EM: COMMIT TRANSACTION
deactivate EM

Service -> EM: SELECT updated wallets
EM --> Service: { from, to }

Service --> Controller: { from, to }
Controller --> Client: 200 OK\n{ from: { id, balance, ... },\n  to: { id, balance, ... } }

== Erreurs possibles (alt global) ==

note over Client, DB
  **Erreurs et codes de réponse :**
  - 400 "Impossible de transférer vers le même wallet"
  - 400 "Aucun PIN configuré"
  - 400 "Solde insuffisant"
  - 400 "Transfert entre devises différentes non supporté"
  - 403 "PIN incorrect"
  - 403 "Wallet temporairement verrouillé (15 min)"
  - 404 "Wallet source introuvable"
  - 404 "Wallet destination introuvable"
  - 409 "Concurrence détectée" (deadlock retry)
end note

@enduml
